# Homepage Architecture

The homepage (`pages/index.vue`) is a thin orchestrator. Sections live in `components/index/`.

```
pages/index.vue                 ← orchestrator: chat transitions, focus panel, lifecycle
composables/useScrollSections.ts ← scroll-section registry, hash sync, Lenis scrollTo
components/index/
  HeroSection.vue                 Hero + GSAP entrance (avatar, name, motto, chat input)
  PostsSection.vue                Blog posts grid + "View All" expansion/search + GSAP
  SpaceSection.vue                Gallery, About & Contact cards + GSAP
  ToolsSection.vue                Dev tools grid + GSAP
  FooterSection.vue               Footer + GSAP
  FocusContent.vue                Focus panel content (post/about/contact/gallery)
  MobileNav.vue                   Mobile nav FAB + overlay
```

## Section tags (hash routing)

| URL | Section | Notes |
|-----|---------|-------|
| `/` (no hash) | Main page (top / hero) | Default. Scrolling back up clears hash. |
| `/#chat` | Chat | Conditional on `chatHasMessages`. Falls back to `/`. |
| `/#posts` | Posts | Blog post cards. |
| `/#space` | Space | Gallery, About, Contact — grouped. |
| `/#tools` | Tools | Dev tools grid. |

Focus-panel hashes (`#tool/…`) are handled by `useFocusPanel` — the scroll-sections composable ignores them.
`#about` → redirects to `/about`, `#contact` → redirects to `/contact`, `#gallery` → redirects to `/#space`, `#post/…` → redirects to standalone blog page.

## Key patterns

- **Each section owns its GSAP scroll animations** — colocated in its own `onMounted`.
  Mobile detection (`window.innerWidth < 1024`) is checked locally per component.
- **Scroll-attached navigation uses `useScrollSections`** — Lenis-powered `scrollTo`,
  IntersectionObserver-based active section tracking, and bidirectional hash sync.
- **Focus panel content loading stays in `index.vue`** — bridges panel openers and FocusContent.
- **`BlogPost` type** is exported via a regular `<script>` block in PostsSection.vue
  (since `<script setup>` forbids exports).
- Components expose only what the parent needs via `defineExpose`:
  - HeroSection: `getInputEl()` (hero input entrance animation)
  - PostsSection: `expandAllPosts()`, `scrollToPosts()` (mobile nav)

## Core composables

| Composable | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `useScrollSections` | Section registry, active section (IntersectionObserver), hash sync, Lenis `scrollTo` |
| `useFocusPanel` | Panel stack, hash routing (`#about`, `#post/…`), scroll preservation |
| `useCanvasCamera` | Horizontal pan between discovery (left) and focus (right) columns |
| `useChatty` | SSE streaming chat client with localStorage persistence |
| `useColorFlow` | Scroll-scrubbed background color interpolation |
